{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive into the exhilarating world of Tharaba (\u0636\u0631\u0627\u0628\u0647)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a thrilling score-chasing Arcade game that challenges players to master the art of precision and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729370/extras/f2e7c3dc5beb25b7b0f7a7a7f128e187.poster.avif?t=1771608614\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729370/extras/f2e7c3dc5beb25b7b0f7a7a7f128e187.webm?t=1771608614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729370/extras/f2e7c3dc5beb25b7b0f7a7a7f128e187.mp4?t=1771608614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tharaba revolves around the concept of precision and timing, where each hit must be perfectly executed to score. The goal is to defeat enemies by strategically timing your attacks and dodges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-Chasing Mechanics</strong>: The primary objective is to attain the highest score possible, while not losing health. Each precise move contributes to your overall score, encouraging players to continuously refine their techniques and strive for perfection in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of well-timed strikes and flawless maneuvers to secure the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Towards Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2729370/b292c08a230a7793ad827f79d5368513f89a